As for what?

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:15.570
as Otumka or his spectre inferred.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.740
Perhaps it was for this particular time.

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:20.690
And this particular place.

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:25.960
have the stubbornness.

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:28.260
to continue against the...

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:29.860
The most impossible.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.420
No obstacles?

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.240
find the courage.

