00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:02.530
Unless your nation enters the war.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:03.640
And that is a fact.

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:07.840
And can you promise me that France will come to our aid?

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:09.740
Cannot promise that.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:12.420
But I have every hope that...

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.020
Every hope?

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:14.930
What is your...

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:21.680
