00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:26.240
At the moment, yes. But...

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:31.410
Dispatches thrive, sir.

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:39.040
Oh, I'm sorry, General.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.920
a short letter from Major Williams.

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:43.850
General Gates is tough.

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:50.990
friend and admirer.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:56.940
I feel it my duty to report that a letter to General Gates

