00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:17.220
That is nothing but talk. It is not even worth your anger.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.120
And go on the way.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.770
You know what an old woman he is, everybody knows.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:24.830
He is bitter.

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:26.760
and envious of your position.

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:28.990
He tried merely to make the difficulty.

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:43.680
There's more. You will be interested to know that General Conway has just been selected a general.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.160
Conway Inspector General.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:50.870
Conway will now be spokesman to the Congress, Ray Army.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:54.680
Conway will plead our cause with the flies.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.880
Conway will advise Congress as to the wisdom of my strategies.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:07.190
Anyway, to address my appeals for help to him.

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:11.420
They made their message plain enough.

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:16.380
I accept their wish, longer commanding general.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:21.700
No, General Washington.

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:25.540
You are permitting your emotion to rule reason.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.220
You have become a symbol of the revolution.

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:29.980
If you turn your back on it now.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.830
