00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:35.260
I am not responsible for the image others create of me.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:39.910
But you are responsible to your best self, General Washington.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:45.780
My friend, please do not act in haste and anger.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:55.010
Sir, my staff is to be here for an urgent meeting at 9 sharp.

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:55.350
Yes.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:28.420
I think you are very tired of fighting the Congress.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:40.890
In addition to all that, the responsibility of waging a war on so many fronts is more than any one man should have to bear.

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:52.980
We're no longer able to see things clearly. They're all Washington.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.820
I'll regret this more than I can say.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:07.580
But I realize that once you have made a decision, it is hopeless to try and dissuade you.

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:19.660
Trust my decision will not affect our personal feelings for one another.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:26.080
Nothing could do that, Moldenar.

