I saw our nation victorious.

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:10.580
I saw it grow in size and power.

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:14.680
Come the major force for good on this earth.

00:22:15.610 --> 00:22:15.930
Saw it.

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:22.400
Green vision.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:29.240
I know it will come.

